+<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Little River, SC a city, and what county is it in?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Little River is not a city. It is an unincorporated community in Horry County, South Carolina, at the North Carolina line, and the county runs it."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How far is Little River from Myrtle Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"About 18 minutes by car to Barefoot Landing and about 36 to Coastal Grand Mall in Myrtle Beach, without traffic. The airport is about 41 minutes away."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Little River, SC flood?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Homes by the Intracoastal Waterway can. Nearly half the homes within about 50 feet of the water are in FEMA's high-risk flood zone, against about four in every hundred of all homes."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the property tax in Little River, SC?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A home you live in pays only the county's property tax and a county fee, with no city tax on top. A second home or rental is taxed at a higher rate than a home you live in."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much is a boat slip in Little River?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Deeded slips at Mariner's Pointe sold for $10,000 to $38,000 in the past year. Slips at Dock Holidays, across the line in North Myrtle Beach, sold for far more."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How many people live in Little River, SC?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"About 11,700 people lived in Little River at the 2020 Census, nearly a third more than in 2010."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Little River, SC safe?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We do not rate any place as safe or unsafe. The FBI's Crime Data Explorer and the South Carolina Law Enforcement Division publish reported crime by police agency."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which schools serve Little River, SC?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Horry County Schools assigns schools by address, in nine attendance areas, and none is named Little River. We look up the assigned schools for any house you like."}}]}</script>
